    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play the Tape. Discover the Truth. Open the Museum.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In swamp_land.mp4, an atmospheric <strong>walking simulator</strong> with a <strong>found footage horror</strong> twist, you take on the role of a reclusive curator preparing to open a mysterious museum deep in the <strong>forests of southern Chile</strong>. But before the grand opening, you must confront your past\u2014through a haunting metaphorical journey across the <strong>7 levels of Dante\u2019s Inferno</strong>, each representing a sin\u2026 and a secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore surreal, decaying landscapes tied to <strong>Pride, Envy, Wrath, Sloth, Greed, Gluttony, and Lust</strong>, where <strong>every step reveals a fragment of your story</strong>. What begins as a personal reflection soon unravels into something far darker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>compelling narrative</strong> with unexpected <strong>twists and turns</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roughly <strong>30 minutes</strong> of immersive, story-driven gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <strong>found footage aesthetics</strong> and psychological horror</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play the Tape. Discover the Truth. Open the Museum.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In swamp_land.mp4, an atmospheric <strong>walking simulator</strong> with a <strong>found footage horror</strong> twist, you take on the role of a reclusive curator preparing to open a mysterious museum deep in the <strong>forests of southern Chile</strong>. But before the grand opening, you must confront your past\u2014through a haunting metaphorical journey across the <strong>7 levels of Dante\u2019s Inferno</strong>, each representing a sin\u2026 and a secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore surreal, decaying landscapes tied to <strong>Pride, Envy, Wrath, Sloth, Greed, Gluttony, and Lust</strong>, where <strong>every step reveals a fragment of your story</strong>. What begins as a personal reflection soon unravels into something far darker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>compelling narrative</strong> with unexpected <strong>twists and turns</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roughly <strong>30 minutes</strong> of immersive, story-driven gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <strong>found footage aesthetics</strong> and psychological horror</p></li></ul>",
